
👽 test linux/amd64

Validate authentication configuration for syntax and logical errors. Without -- stack, validate atmos.yaml. With --stack, validate each concrete component’s merged authentication configuration without authenticating or evaluating dynamic stack expressions.

USAGE


    $ atmos auth validate [flags]


FLAGS

  -c, --component string  Limit scoped validation to this component (requires --stack)

  -h, --help              help for validate

  -s, --stack string      Validate merged auth for every concrete component in this stack

  -v, --verbose           Enable verbose output



Use --help=usage for examples or --help=all for all flags and full help.

  Documentation: https://atmos.tools/cli/commands/auth/validate
